  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "要对自己有信心  (Have Confidence in Yourself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Wang Er's office, Wang Er hands Bu Xiaogu his personal talent-agency contacts so she can carry out her backup plan herself, urging her to stop doubting herself. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资源都是我多年攒下的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你去了提我的名字，准好使。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您这么信任我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "方案是你想出来的，当然应该由你来实施。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "不要老想着自己是实习生没经验。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "抓住机会，锻炼自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你早晚会成长的，要对自己有信心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，谢谢您！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "行了，别站着了，去完成你的任务！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's unpack the pep talk from Wang Er line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资源都是我多年攒下的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of these contacts are ones I saved up over many years.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你去了提我的名字，准好使。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mention my name when you go, and it will definitely work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您这么信任我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you trust me this much?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "方案是你想出来的，当然应该由你来实施。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You thought up the plan, so of course you should be the one to carry it out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "不要老想着自己是实习生没经验。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop always thinking that you are an intern with no experience.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "抓住机会，锻炼自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seize the opportunity and toughen yourself through practice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你早晚会成长的，要对自己有信心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sooner or later you will grow; you need to have confidence in yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，谢谢您！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Teacher Wang, thank you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "行了，别站着了，去完成你的任务！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, stop standing around — go complete your mission!'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这些资源都是我多年攒下的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你去了提我的名字，准好使。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您这么信任我吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "方案是你想出来的，当然应该由你来实施。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "不要老想着自己是实习生没经验。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "抓住机会，锻炼自己。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你早晚会成长的，要对自己有信心。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "王老师，谢谢您！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "行了，别站着了，去完成你的任务！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Armed with Wang Er's contacts and fresh confidence, Xiaogu sets to work — unaware that Ji Xiu is about to drop by for lunch. You learned \"xinren\", \"jihui\", and \"you xinxin\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
